{"id": "9701", "type": "page", "slug": "alumni", "path": "alumni", "title": "Alumni", "date": "2026-08-19 12:14:25", "modified": "2026-08-25 18:10:39", "excerpt": "", "content": "<section><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-alumni-hero-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\nAlumni\r\n<h1>Building Longevity Together</h1>\r\nWhether you come to Hippocrates as a guest, physician, researcher, educator, philanthropist, business leader, wellness practitioner, or simply someone who believes there is a better way forward — we welcome you.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"#hub\">Continue your journey→</a>\r\n<a href=\"#return\">Plan your return</a>\r\n\r\n</section><section>The relationship continues\r\n<h2>What began on campus is meant to keep going</h2>\r\nEvery week, people who stayed here are still preparing the food, keeping the rhythm, and calling the team with questions. That is not the end of a program — it is what the program was for.\r\n\r\nThis page keeps the door open.\r\n<figure><button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1058682767?autoplay=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" aria-label=\"Play the video\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-alumni-promo-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n▶\r\n</button></figure>\r\n</section><section>\r\n<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-alumni-home-2.jpg\" alt=\"A guest meditating at home, continuing the daily practice between visits\" /></figure>\r\nHippocrates @Home\r\n<h2>Keep the rhythm where you actually live</h2>\r\nHippocrates at Home holds the practical side: the supplements, sprouting and juicing supplies, skincare and coaching you may already know from campus, and carefully orchestrated education specifically for the Hippocrates@Home community.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/at-home/\">Explore Hippocrates at Home→</a>\r\n<a href=\"http://at-home.html#recommender\">Take the @Home check→</a>\r\n\r\nEvery gift, of any size, carries this mission into its next seventy years.\r\n\r\n</section><section>Ways to Stay Connected\r\n<h2>The Ambassador Circle</h2>\r\nWe invite you to discover not only what Hippocrates is today — but what we are becoming. Education creates understanding. Community strengthens commitment. Environment influences behavior. And daily practice creates lasting transformation.\r\n\r\nYour standing membership in the community, begins the day you graduate.\r\n\r\n01\r\nAccess to the online alumni community — recipes, encouragement, and shared progress\r\n02\r\nA monthly alumnus gathering online, hosted from campus by a faculty member\r\n03\r\nSeasonal living-food guides and at-home practices to keep the rhythm going\r\n04\r\nAmbassador Alliance Opportunities: $500 Referral for successfully enrolling new Hippocrates guests\r\n05\r\nFirst word on 70th Anniversary gatherings around the world, Homecoming, and campus events\r\n\r\n</section><section>Return to campus\r\n<h2>You are always welcome back</h2>\r\nThe People. In healing, we are never alone. Time and again, what guests say made the difference wasn’t any single therapy, but the community: the shared meals, the shared walks, the people who understood without being told. That connection is not meant to last twenty-one days. It’s meant to last 120-years.\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>A repeat stay</li>\r\n \t<li>An event or gathering</li>\r\n \t<li>A campus tour with someone you are bringing</li>\r\n \t<li>Continuing education on campus</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjM1NDQiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D\">Plan your return→</a>\r\n<a href=\"#community\">See upcoming events→</a>\r\n\r\nTransformation does not happen because someone learns something new. It happens when a new way of living becomes their everyday reality.\r\n<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-alumni-campus-2.jpg\" alt=\"A guest raising a hand during a class on the Hippocrates campus\" /></figure>\r\n</section><section>Alumni voices\r\n<h2>Where the journey continues</h2>\r\nPersonal accounts from guests who have stayed with us. Individual experiences, not predicted outcomes.\r\n\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051088353?h=195ddc6682&amp;autoplay=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" aria-label=\"Play the video: Jennifer\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-jennifer-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n▶\r\nJennifer\r\nLife Transformation Program alumna\r\n</button>\r\n<blockquote>“\r\n\r\nI arrived exhausted and I left with a way of eating and living that I actually understood.\r\n\r\n<footer>Jennifer\r\nLife Transformation Program alumna</footer></blockquote>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051094995?h=a0511f65ee&amp;autoplay=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" aria-label=\"Play the video: Arthur\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-arthur-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n▶\r\nArthur\r\nHippocrates alumnus, 2023\r\n</button>\r\n<blockquote>“\r\n\r\nA compassionate team, and a place that pays attention to the whole person, not one number.\r\n\r\n<footer>Arthur\r\nHippocrates alumnus, 2023</footer></blockquote>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051094959?h=fd35aa935d&amp;autoplay=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" aria-label=\"Play the video: Marrisa\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-marrisa-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n▶\r\nMarrisa\r\nHippocrates alumna, 2022\r\n</button>\r\n<blockquote>“\r\n\r\nWhat has stayed with me is the knowledge — every meal at home is different now.\r\n\r\n<footer>Marrisa\r\nHippocrates alumna, 2022</footer></blockquote>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051095071?h=e1965cab3e&amp;autoplay=1&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0&amp;dnt=1\" aria-label=\"Play the video: Synia\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-synia-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n▶\r\nSynia\r\nHippocrates alumni story\r\n</button>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li><button type=\"button\" data-hw-scelta=\"0\" aria-current=\"true\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-jennifer-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\nJennifer\r\nLife Transformation Program alumna\r\n</button></li>\r\n \t<li><button type=\"button\" data-hw-scelta=\"1\" aria-current=\"false\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-arthur-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\nArthur\r\nHippocrates alumnus, 2023\r\n</button></li>\r\n \t<li><button type=\"button\" data-hw-scelta=\"2\" aria-current=\"false\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-marrisa-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\nMarrisa\r\nHippocrates alumna, 2022\r\n</button></li>\r\n \t<li><button type=\"button\" data-hw-scelta=\"3\" aria-current=\"false\">\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-synia-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\nSynia\r\nHippocrates alumni story\r\n</button></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIndividual experiences vary. Testimonials describe personal experience and are not a promise of results.\r\n\r\n</section><section>Pass it on\r\n<h2>Two ways alumni help most</h2>\r\nA referral and a review are the two things alumni are most often asked for — so they sit side by side, at equal weight, and neither is dressed as a reward scheme.\r\n\r\nRefer a friend\r\n<h3>Introduce someone you care about</h3>\r\nWe will send them a short, personal introduction — not a marketing campaign. Please don’t include anything about their health.\r\n\r\n<style>.elementor-9888 .elementor-element.elementor-element-370d6866{--display:flex;}.elementor-widget-form .elementor-field-group > label, .elementor-widget-form .elementor-field-subgroup label{color:var( --e-global-color-text );}.elementor-widget-form .elementor-field-group > label{font-family:var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-text-font-size );font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-text-font-w